The public Garden Circle tells a travelling history: Bogotá in twenty twenty-two, Istanbul in twenty twenty-three, Bangkok in twenty twenty-four, Buenos Aires in twenty twenty-five, then Shenzhen and Mumbai in twenty twenty-six. These are memories of real rooms, not proof of membership in a future DAO. The publicly shared Road to Lisbon now points toward Devcon nine, scheduled for October eleventh through thirteenth, twenty twenty-seven. The community hopes to propose a music space when Devcon opens that process. Devcon has not approved it, and no venue, booking, funding, or appearance is promised. The open join page welcomes musicians, developers, designers, translators, sound crew, listeners, and people whose role has not been named yet. Remote contribution is welcome too.
